<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Select raised at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Select raised at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Select Appointments Plc was raised to the &quot;recommended list&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; by Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available. The stock was up 5p at 473-1/2 by 1015 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
